  The reel_script says the rain at Bhavani area was 'பலத்த மழை' lasting until 5 PM, which matches, but the reel_script names 'கூடுதுறை' and 'காலிங்கராயன்பாளையம' as places where rain fell, which is consistent with the article; however the slides_spec 'மழை அளவு' slide says 'ஈரோடு 4.40 மி.மீ.' and 'பவானி 4 மி.மீ.' while the article says these were recorded on the day BEFORE (நேற்று முன்தினம்), not the day of the storm — the draft presents them as part of the same report without this date distinction in the reel_script and slides_spec, mixing two different days' facts
