  The reel_script says Harivignesh was arrested after DMK members staged a protest, but the article only states DMK members protested and Harivignesh was arrested; the sentence links the two as cause and effect, which the article does not explicitly establish.
  The caption says 'ஈரோடு பி.எஸ். பார்க் மற்றும் முனிசிபல் காலனியில் உள்ள ... நூலகக் கண்ணாடிகள் ... சேதப்படுத்தப்பட்டன', which mixes the statues and the library glass into the same sentence with the Modakkurichi statue; the article lists these separately, so the grouping is loose.
